{"meetingId": "526", "tickets": [
{"title": "Open support case for duplicate portal balance feed", "text": "Open a support case with Velvet Acorn Custody for Nora Willowdoodle's planning portal, which displays the taxable joint account twice and overstates household net worth by roughly one duplicated account after a custodian connection refresh. Suppress the duplicate display while the case is pending and confirm when the portal view reconciles to the custodian statement.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2026-03-17", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": null, "subTasks": [], "evidence": "The agreed follow-up is to open a support case, suppress the duplicate display while the case is pending, and confirm when the portal view reconciles to the custodian statement by March 17, 2026."},
{"title": "Trace pending IRA contribution with custodian", "text": "Trace the recent IRA contribution for Nora Willowdoodle that still shows as pending in the client portal even though funds left Teacup Comet Bank. Confirm with Velvet Acorn Custody whether it was coded to the correct tax year and report back before Nora's next estimated tax package is finalized.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2026-03-20", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": null, "subTasks": [], "evidence": "The agreed follow-up is to trace the movement with the custodian, confirm whether it was coded to the correct tax year, and report back before Nora’s next estimated tax package is finalized, by March 20, 2026."},
{"title": "Request trust certification and resubmit retitling packet", "text": "Request a fresh trust certification from attorney Petra Maplesprocket's office for Nora and Calvin Willowdoodle and resubmit the cabin reserve account retitling packet to Velvet Acorn Custody once received. The custodian rejected the retitling because the previously uploaded certification was not visible in the service file.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2026-03-24", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": null, "subTasks": [], "evidence": "The agreed follow-up is to request a fresh copy from Petra’s office and resubmit the retitling packet once received, by March 24, 2026."},
{"title": "Verify IRA beneficiary record and prepare corrected forms", "text": "Verify the custodian beneficiary record for Nora Willowdoodle's IRA at Velvet Acorn Custody, which shows no contingent beneficiary while the planning file lists Calvin as primary and Iris Thimblefern as contingent. Prepare corrected beneficiary forms if the custodian display is accurate and explain the discrepancy in the next status note.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2026-03-31", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": null, "subTasks": [], "evidence": "The agreed follow-up is to verify the custodian record, prepare corrected beneficiary forms if the custodian display is accurate, and explain the discrepancy in the next status note by March 31, 2026."},
{"title": "Confirm new assisted-living transfer instructions", "text": "Help Nora Willowdoodle confirm the new receiving instructions after Iris Thimblefern's assisted-living community changed its payment processor, so the next family support transfer of $2,400 per month arrives without interruption. Test the updated external transfer setup and document the revised payment path in the household service notes.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2026-03-18", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": null, "subTasks": [], "evidence": "The agreed follow-up is to help confirm the new receiving instructions, test the updated external transfer setup, and document the revised payment path in the household service notes by March 18, 2026."},
{"title": "Compile tax figures and send package to Nora", "text": "Compile realized gain, dividend, interest, and withholding figures from available custodial records for Nora and Calvin Willowdoodle and send the package to Nora for review before it goes to CPA Jonah Copperwisp, who is waiting on account income figures before giving the next estimated tax payment amount.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2026-03-27", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": null, "subTasks": [], "evidence": "The agreed follow-up is to compile realized gain, dividend, interest, and withholding figures from available custodial records and send the package to Nora for review before it goes to the CPA, by March 27, 2026."},
{"title": "Disable stale Pocket Lantern Bank transfer link", "text": "Work with Velvet Acorn Custody to disable the stale external link to the closed Pocket Lantern Bank checking account in Nora Willowdoodle's custodian profile, which Nora does not recognize as active. Confirm that only current Teacup Comet Bank instructions remain available for transfers.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2026-03-21", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": null, "subTasks": [], "evidence": "The agreed follow-up is to work with the custodian to disable the stale link and confirm that only current Teacup Comet Bank instructions remain available by March 21, 2026."},
{"title": "Send consolidated secure portal status message", "text": "Send Nora Willowdoodle one secure portal message summarizing all open service items: the duplicate feed, IRA contribution trace, retitling packet, beneficiary verification, transfer setup, tax data package, and stale bank-link cleanup. Nora prefers a single consolidated update rather than separate messages for every open item.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2026-03-28", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": null, "subTasks": [], "evidence": "The agreed follow-up is for Apricot Compass Advisory to send one secure portal message summarizing the duplicate feed, IRA contribution trace, retitling packet, beneficiary verification, transfer setup, tax data package, and stale bank-link cleanup by March 28, 2026."}
]}
